Before finalizing your fix, verify:

### ✅ No Invented APIs
Every function/method you call must exist in:
- Python standard library
- Imports explicitly provided in IMPORT_BLOCK
- The original code snippet
- **NEVER** invent function names or method signatures

### ✅ No Scope Violations
You may only reference:
